Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.74,0:00:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to die, abandoned and waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.83,0:00:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Four days. August 15th.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.87,0:00:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,The world itself has decided that you will die.
