Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.73,0:02:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay! This will...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.40,0:02:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.40,0:02:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The IBN 5100 is in a coin locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.32,0:02:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Moeka told me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.12,0:03:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,it hasn't been recovered yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.08,0:03:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.99,0:03:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What else?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.29,0:03:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll break the locker open with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.00,0:03:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.21,0:03:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.13,0:03:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything that's happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.21,0:03:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite all the D-Mails you've undone,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.09,0:03:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,you haven't recovered the IBN 5100.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.18,0:03:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Most likely, it'll be impossible until you get back
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.43,0:03:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,to the original worldline.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.22,0:03:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And for that to happen, you have to do things in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.32,0:03:39.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.07,0:03:41.03,Default,,0,0,0,,But now, we have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.08,0:03:47.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Kiryu Moeka will do whatever this FB says, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.71,0:03:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And FB's the leader, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.84,0:03:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.80,0:04:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If I stake out the IBN 5100, maybe I'll see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.23,0:04:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.90,0:04:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to see FB too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.99,0:04:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you want to avoid seeing her
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.41,0:04:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,because she'd hate you or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.41,0:04:26.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.04,0:04:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What good will it do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think I'd work with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.18,0:04:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I guess I can talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.82,0:04:55.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.27,0:04:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,N-Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.44,0:04:59.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're with Kiryu Moeka?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.82,0:05:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,She's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.99,0:05:04.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just how it worked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.03,0:05:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,If something happens, I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.45,0:05:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.62,0:05:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.58,0:05:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Was that Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.38,0:05:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.47,0:05:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.63,0:05:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like, lately, Okarin and I haven't talked at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.52,0:05:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.90,0:05:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Nae!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.61,0:05:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi there, Miss Assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.08,0:05:48.91,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Big Sis Kurisu{-oneechan}.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.37,0:05:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry about yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.29,0:05:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell Okabe his rent's going up 5,000 yen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.96,0:05:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:06:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I haven't seen him today.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.05,0:06:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he get sick or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:05.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Although, they say idiots don't get sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.68,0:06:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's looking for stuff to use in his experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.85,0:06:11.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Experiments, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.39,0:06:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What a lucky guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.65,0:06:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a student with his own damn room,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.11,0:06:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,has friends like you guys,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.82,0:06:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and can do whatever he wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.07,0:06:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He really is lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.07,0:06:25.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.57,0:06:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy, if we don't hurry, we'll miss the clearance sale!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.16,0:06:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! Let's go, Nae!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, big sisters!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.37,0:06:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.00,0:06:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.00,0:06:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.56,0:06:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,A message from FB?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.19,0:06:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I see it?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:12.70,0:07:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,"I think M4 was right."
Comment: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:22.67,CellphoneR,,0,0,0,,I think M4 was right. \NTo be honest, no one works \Nas hard as M4.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:22.67,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\an2\blur3\frx4\fry0\frz339.377\move(771,946.5,856.5,832.5,23,8323)}I think M4 was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.33,0:07:22.67,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\an2\blur3\frx4\fry0\frz339.664\move(667.5,993,753,874.5,0,8323)}To be honest, no one works as hard as M4.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:17.17,0:07:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,"To be honest, no one works as hard as M4."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.42,0:07:24.92,Default,,0,0,0,,M4?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the code name FB gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.14,0:07:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Only FB and I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.93,0:07:34.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.18,0:07:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,"That's true."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.02,0:07:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,"You may be bad at social interactions, M4,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.36,0:07:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,but that's part of what makes you you."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.28,0:07:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A mom, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.27,0:08:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.23,0:08:19.23,Default,,0,0,0,,the IBN 5100!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.85,0:08:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Then is {\i1}he{\i0} FB?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.65,0:08:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,FB is a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.21,0:08:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I know him!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.65,0:09:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.79,0:09:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.91,0:09:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll explain later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.53,0:09:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mister Braun?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So, have you driven since you got your license?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.76,0:10:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.13,0:10:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please drive safely.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.76,0:10:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you ever seen him before?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.06,0:10:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.89,0:10:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.61,0:10:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Four days. August 15th.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.70,0:10:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The world itself has decided that you will die.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.54,0:10:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.91,0:11:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's on a plane to France,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.12,0:11:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN's country of origin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.12,0:11:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We never saw any women who could've been FB.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.17,0:11:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,At least give me a damn phone call!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.34,0:11:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I was busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.63,0:11:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not about me,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.89,0:11:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.93,0:11:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.85,0:11:45.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.39,0:11:47.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's been a long time since we last spoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.65,0:11:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She said the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.61,0:11:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.20,0:11:57.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.53,0:11:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have to ask him directly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.95,0:12:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Ask {\i1}him{\i0}?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.45,0:12:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He's someone we know very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.84,0:12:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you here so early?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.47,0:12:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.27,0:12:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.23,0:12:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you come to pay the extra 6,000 yen I added to your rent?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.03,0:12:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on now. You're supposed to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.28,0:12:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,"That's 1,000 more yen than you said!"
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something I'd like to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.91,0:12:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with the formality?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.66,0:12:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You know someone named FB, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.42,0:12:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We saw it all,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.63,0:12:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,including the IBN 5100 being taken from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.09,0:13:03.43,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't care about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.43,0:13:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We just want to see FB.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.22,0:13:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Please tell me where she is.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.40,0:13:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You sold us out, M4.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.57,0:13:22.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the code name FB gave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.57,0:13:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Only FB and I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.66,0:13:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.45,0:13:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.45,0:13:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever heard of Ferdinand Braun?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.92,0:13:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,The Nobel laureate who invented the Braun tube.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.25,0:13:36.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.67,0:13:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,And what are his initials?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.09,0:13:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,FB.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.30,0:13:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.05,0:13:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be true!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.93,0:13:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you just follow blindly and avoid reality?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.89,0:13:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Nae is asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.19,0:13:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.57,0:14:03.66,Default,,0,0,0,,This town keeps changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.41,0:14:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really FB?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.79,0:14:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.37,0:14:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But those messages...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.46,0:14:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I wrote them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I write like a woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.05,0:14:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,To trick you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.71,0:14:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Bu—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.34,0:14:22.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You weren't the only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.80,0:14:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I message others too,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,all under the guise of whomever they needed the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.26,0:14:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, people like you are the easiest to trick, which helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.56,0:14:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why break off contact with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.40,0:14:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The second she found the IBN 5100, I didn't need her anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.20,0:14:45.07,Default,,0,0,0,,so I cut off contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.45,0:14:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,We collect members through text messages.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.16,0:14:50.49,Default,,0,0,0,,People like that are the easiest to deal with
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.49,0:14:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and the easiest to get rid of when we're done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.08,0:14:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't belong anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.33,0:14:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you're SERN's dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.71,0:14:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.25,0:15:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzuha... Hashida Suzu
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.42,0:15:06.39,Default,,0,0,0,,didn't take care of you for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.51,0:15:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know about Suzu?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.18,0:15:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzu has nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.90,0:15:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.90,0:15:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.82,0:15:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you know?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.49,0:15:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever sleep in a sewer in the middle of winter?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.62,0:15:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I was still a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.54,0:15:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The concrete was so cold
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.46,0:15:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,that it seeped into your bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.79,0:15:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't eat for three or four days at a time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.63,0:15:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I laid down,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.72,0:15:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,they came.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.68,0:15:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Rats. They thought I was dead and came to eat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.98,0:16:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,But then, I saw a thread descend,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.31,0:16:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,as thin as a spider's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.32,0:16:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I had no choice but to climb it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.90,0:16:07.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if, by the top,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.24,0:16:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd end up with dirty hands,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.12,0:16:18.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I kept climbing the thread.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.54,0:16:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Before I knew it, I was a marionette.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.26,0:16:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.47,0:16:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The puppets who {\i1}do{\i0} escape the thread,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.43,0:17:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,those traitors die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.39,0:17:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, once you complete your mission, you also die.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.06,0:17:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You called me a dog, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.73,0:17:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm worse than a dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.65,0:17:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm cattle.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.78,0:17:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I've thought of running before,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.83,0:17:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but I have someone I care about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.79,0:17:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to get her involved,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.33,0:17:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,but failure isn't an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.17,0:17:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,If you run, they go after your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.39,0:17:56.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I failed too,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.93,0:17:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but Nae won't know anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,as long as I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.30,0:18:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.18,0:18:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.98,0:18:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.23,0:18:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.95,0:19:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Okabe, his phone!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.95,0:19:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The D-Mail!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.50,0:19:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe!
Comment: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:15.05,CellphoneL,,0,0,0,,To: M4\NStop searching for the IBN 5100, \Nand return to stand by. \NDo not act under any circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.09,0:19:15.05,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\be3\an4\fs45\pos(409.5,1023)}Stop searching for the IBN 5100, and return to standby. \NDo not act under any circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.65,0:19:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Moeka...
Comment: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:35.24,CellphoneL,,0,0,0,,From: Shining Finger \N Subject: No Subject \NI won't need the IBN 5100 for a while. \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:35.24,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\be6\fs60\frz29.051\frx4\fry6\move(1372.5,129,1296,24,0,2442)\fax.1}Shining Finger
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:35.24,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\be6\frx2\fry2\frz29.928\move(1245,346.5,1173,243,0,2400)\fax.1}(No Subject)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.78,0:19:35.24,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\an4\be6\frz30.349\frx2\fry0\move(813,975,738,861,0,2442)\fax.1}I won't need the IBN 5100 for a while. \NMoeka
Dialogue: 1,0:19:34.40,0:19:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need it?
Comment: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:42.83,CellphoneL,,0,0,0,,From: Shining Finger \N Subject: No Subject \NMy boss said to stop looking for it. \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:42.83,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\be6\fs60\frz29.051\frx4\fry6\pos(1278,79.5)\fax.1}Shining Finger
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:42.83,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\be6\frx2\fry2\frz29.928\pos(1158,295.5)\fax.1}(No Subject)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.08,0:19:42.83,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\be6\an4\pos(781.5,813)\frz30.142\frx2\fry0\fax.1}My boss said to stop looking for it. \NMoeka
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.04,0:19:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is Urushibara.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.25,0:19:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Kyouma—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.71,0:19:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What? An IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.67,0:19:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.05,0:19:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.85,0:20:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.72,0:20:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashida's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.43,0:20:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he was going to ComiMa.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.60,0:20:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Please,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.73,0:20:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,hear my request!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.19,0:20:17.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.32,0:20:20.37,Default,,0,0,0,,To save Mayuri,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.37,0:20:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,we need to get out of this Alpha worldline
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.83,0:20:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and return to the worldline where you didn't sent the first D-Mail,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.00,0:20:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,the Beta worldline.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.13,0:20:35.17,Default,,0,0,0,,For that to happen, we have to erase the information from SERN's database.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.17,0:20:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushi dies, and Miss Amane is my daughter from the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.93,0:20:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's all bullshit, I think Okarin could become quite the writer.{super lib}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.10,0:20:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish that was true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.27,0:20:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You believe it, Miss Makise?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.14,0:20:49.85,Default,,0,0,0,,For a hypothesis,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.85,0:20:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,if feasible, I'd prefer some reliable, objective data,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.11,0:20:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,but I guess that's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.53,0:20:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The time leap machine you made worked perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.16,0:21:01.87,Default,,0,0,0,,D-Did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.70,0:21:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,O-Of course it did!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.83,0:21:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.79,0:21:10.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.92,0:21:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.79,0:21:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I said nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.50,0:21:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,It's connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.51,0:21:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to know the settings, but I can start in ten minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.76,0:21:22.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, supah hakah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.47,0:21:24.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Super hacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.56,0:21:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The first D-Mail, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.52,0:21:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the one where I was stabbed, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.61,0:21:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you try to feel me up or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.03,0:21:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}By undoing all the D-Mails, I'd return to the original worldline:
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.20,0:21:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the worldline in which SERN doesn't establish a dystopia
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.29,0:21:56.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and the worldline in which Mayuri doesn't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.25,0:22:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However, in that worldline...
